{
    "name":  "WooCommerce new order SMS alert via RCSZilla",
    "nodes":  [
                  {
                      "parameters":  {
                                         "content":  "## Description\n\nGet an instant SMS on your phone every time a new WooCommerce order is placed. This is the simplest possible SMS workflow for WooCommerce store owners who are new to n8n.\n\nNo customer phone required. No complex data extraction. Just three nodes: a WooCommerce trigger, a message builder, and RCSZilla to queue the SMS.\n\n## Setup Guide\n\n1. Install the RCSZilla community node package: n8n-nodes-rcszilla.\n2. Create an RCSZilla API credential in n8n.\n3. Create a WooCommerce credential in n8n:\n   - Store URL: your WooCommerce store URL\n   - Consumer Key: WooCommerce > Settings > Advanced > REST API\n   - Consumer Secret: WooCommerce > Settings > Advanced > REST API\n4. Assign the WooCommerce credential to the WooCommerce New Order trigger node.\n5. In the Build Alert Message node, replace +1234567890 with your own mobile number including country code.\n6. Activate the workflow. n8n registers the webhook in WooCommerce automatically.\n7. Place a test order in your store and wait for the SMS.\n\n## Compliance Notes\n\nThis workflow sends SMS to the store owner only. No customer phone numbers are used. No opt-in or consent handling is needed for internal alert messages.",
                                         "height":  1100,
                                         "width":  540,
                                         "color":  4
                                     },
                      "id":  "c0000001-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
                      "name":  "Sticky Note",
                      "type":  "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
                      "position":  [
                                       0,
                                       0
                                   ],
                      "typeVersion":  1
                  },
                  {
                      "parameters":  {
                                         "content":  "## Beginner Checklist\n\nThree things to do before activating:\n\n1. Assign your WooCommerce credential to the trigger node.\n2. Replace +1234567890 in the Build Alert Message node with your real mobile number.\n3. Assign your RCSZilla credential to the RCSZilla node.\n\nThat is all. No code changes needed.",
                                         "height":  200,
                                         "width":  740,
                                         "color":  3
                                     },
                      "id":  "c0000002-0000-0000-0000-000000000002",
                      "name":  "Sticky Note1",
                      "type":  "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
                      "position":  [
                                       608,
